<sect1 id="chapter1_1autotoc_md6_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter1_1autotoc_md6">
<title>Feature toggles</title><para>Enable only the subsystem being implemented to keep feedback loops short. Lua and registry can stay optional while SAT/SMT core and package flow are hardened. Documentation generation stays conditional but on by default in project options.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">cmake<sp/>-S<sp/>.<sp/>-B<sp/>build/lean<sp/>\</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>-DSATTYRE_ENABLE_TESTS=ON<sp/>\</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>-DSATTYRE_ENABLE_DOCS=ON<sp/>\</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>-DSATTYRE_ENABLE_LUA=OFF<sp/>\</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>-DSATTYRE_ENABLE_REGISTRY=ON</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
