<sect1 id="chapter1_1autotoc_md8_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter1_1autotoc_md8">
<title>CMake intent</title><para>The top-level <computeroutput>CMakeLists.txt</computeroutput> defines core targets: <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacesattyre" kindref="compound">sattyre</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput>sattyre-cabi</computeroutput>, and CLI binaries. Optional docs logic should include <computeroutput>docs/CMakeFiles.txt</computeroutput> only when Doxygen exists. The package metadata file <computeroutput>sattyre.pc</computeroutput> is configured from <computeroutput>cmake/sattyre.pc.in</computeroutput>.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">cat<sp/>build/default/sattyre.pc</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">pkg-config<sp/>--cflags<sp/>--libs<sp/>build/default/sattyre.pc</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
