<sect1 id="chapter1_1autotoc_md10_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter1_1autotoc_md10">
<title>Operational invariants</title><para>The build must configure deterministically on a clean checkout. No public header should require private source-only includes. A missing optional dependency should disable only that subsystem, not the entire project.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">cmake<sp/>--install<sp/>build/default<sp/>--prefix<sp/>/tmp/sattyre-install</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">find<sp/>/tmp/sattyre-install<sp/>-maxdepth<sp/>3<sp/>-type<sp/>f<sp/>|<sp/>sort</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
