<sect1 id="chapter1_1autotoc_md12_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter1_1autotoc_md12">
<title>Troubleshooting</title><para>Confirm the selected compiler supports C++20 for public C++ APIs and internal implementation. Confirm include paths for third-party dependencies are only added when corresponding features are enabled. Confirm optional targets are not compiled when feature flags are disabled.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">cmake<sp/>-S<sp/>.<sp/>-B<sp/>build/check<sp/>-DSATTYRE_ENABLE_DOCS=ON</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cmake<sp/>--build<sp/>build/check<sp/>--target<sp/>sattyre-docs</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
